Scope of this license

This MIT license covers the source code in this repository: PHP under `src/`
and `app/`, TypeScript under `app/client/`, SCSS, JSON Schemas under
`schemas/`, scripts under `scripts/`, tests under `tests/`, and the build and
deployment configuration.

It does NOT cover:

- the encyclopedia text under `content/` — that is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0,
  see `content/LICENSE`;
- the fonts under `public/fonts/` — Inter and Source Serif 4, both under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, see `public/fonts/LICENSE.md`;
- the BOLT framework itself, which is a separate package (`bsti/bolt`) with
  its own license and is not distributed from this repository;
- scientific sources cited in the documents — the publishers keep their
  rights.
